    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "话语宛若利刃刺破宁静，目光宛若利刃刺破岁月，脚步宛若利刃刺破命运。",
    "originalSha256": "3ccb2ab883a21931bf626d7df5467830def29b4127c8a35c74959b9328fd4be2",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
