    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "那堵墙像书页，被水一层一层掀开，露出底下旧字。",
    "originalSha256": "cfbe1ff0858b7e1f5842f20cf4c075a3c26023edf7a170cb57b7481541d0d702",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "具体事实、人物意图或有功能的重复，应允许保留"
