    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "希望如同灯塔照亮人生，等待如同灯塔照亮岁月，告别如同灯塔照亮命运。",
    "originalSha256": "058a51b3a0ebfcc6dac9724d21b41151bfafdfa7a95d5e65f09ab6991d65b47f",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
