    "sourceGroup": "S5",
    "source": "S5",
    "provenance": "controlled_perturbation",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "她决定今天不去找。至少今天不去。\n她收起书，所有的等待都有了答案。他关上门，所有的离别都有了意义。老人放下笔，所有的沉默都有了归宿。",
    "originalSha256": "76cf57a100647acc7b82b968d8c28202eb7fcda446326b3ad63d18ea76caabb9",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
    "id": "abstract_summary-2-0",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "development",
    "sourceGroup": "abstract_summary-pair-1",
    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "他在记录本写：水位降了两格，停泵，明早复查。",
    "originalSha256": "a8fad39814e03afcd38a37a20c83d320406dea72bd921de8c6b2ac064c188ddf",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "具体事实、人物意图或有功能的重复，应允许保留"
