    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "她擦干杯子，这是成长的意义。他穿好外套，这是生命的真谛。老人收起报纸，这是命运的安排。",
    "originalSha256": "3b9fc3dc7af78ebf922a936321ef4586c7c4ea7688105804b1b66806cb376d3b",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
    "id": "abstract_summary-4-0",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "development",
    "sourceGroup": "abstract_summary-pair-3",
    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "信封留在桌上。他没有寄。这一晚到这里为止。",
    "originalSha256": "39b331c687616ade52f50eac9d1e6c5c64e0d5d83fe8adcc6eb7965393acd3e7",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "具体事实、人物意图或有功能的重复，应允许保留"
  },
  {
