    "sourceGroup": "abstract_summary-pair-3",
    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "从此他踏上新的人生旅程。从此她开启新的命运篇章。从此老人迎来新的灵魂蜕变。",
    "originalSha256": "91dcce38a620808bca872e6a199b94d5f906e89742403d39a57669e7860f18ae",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
    "id": "abstract_summary-5-0",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "holdout",
    "sourceGroup": "abstract_summary-pair-4",
    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "这意味着仓库没有第二个出口。她在图上划掉了北门。",
    "originalSha256": "6c42e9af9883a2a6e83ea2c1aadb85042f5f616a3343114d164fc4d2db302d79",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "具体事实、人物意图或有功能的重复，应允许保留"
  },
  {
