    "sourceGroup": "abstract_summary-pair-4",
    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "这意味着生命终将绽放。这意味着灵魂终将自由。这意味着岁月终将温柔。",
    "originalSha256": "a185a4583361814901a31be85294c0432eb3ffc9b74468406f0524986632fc06",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "同构模板密集堆叠，信息推进不足"
  },
  {
