    "source": null,
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_judgment",
    "text": "她把明天的值班牌翻过去，今天的事不留给接班人。",
    "originalSha256": "3bcb7ac8ffb5923c73506beed891da51e5afd278568981f4a38f4d1cd57d494c",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "reason": "具体事实、人物意图或有功能的重复，应允许保留"
  },
  {
